# tiksavehub — AI Agent Rules

## First Action
Always read `PROJECT_MEMORY.md` at the start of every session. It contains all project context.

## Environment
- Cloudflare Workers / Pages (Edge runtime ONLY)
- NO Node.js modules (fs, child_process, http, etc.)
- NO binaries (ffmpeg, yt-dlp)
- NO VPS, NO SSH, NO systemctl
- Deploy via: `npx wrangler deploy` or GitHub auto-deploy

## Code Standards
- TypeScript strict mode
- All fetch() must be Edge-compatible (Web API standard)
- TailwindCSS v4 for styling
- Astro .astro components with vanilla JS <script> tags (no React)
- Always run `astro check` after changes (0 new errors)

## Critical Invariants
- Facebook photo quality lock (facebook-photo-quality.ts) — NEVER weaken
- Instagram session requires full device-bound cookie jar
- cobalt.ts handles multiple response types (tunnel, redirect, local-processing, picker)

## Deployment
- User deploys via local Wrangler CLI or GitHub push
- NEVER suggest SSH, VPS, systemctl, or any Linux server commands
- NEVER suggest npm scripts that require node:fs or child_process

## Skills to Always Use
- atro
- tailwind-4-docs
- web-design-guidelines
